 # [ActionItem(task='Send the revised quote to Halden', owner='Ana Ruiz', due=date(2026, 3, 6))]
 ```
 
+The list is capped at 10. If a meeting produces more valid items than that, the extra ones are cut, and undated items are the first to go. To see how many were cut, call `extract_with_overflow` instead; it takes the same arguments and returns `(items, overflow)`, where `overflow` is the number of items dropped (0 when nothing was cut).
+
 Run the tests from this directory with `python -m unittest`.
